WEBVTT

00:01.440 --> 00:06.500
When I set out, I had not eaten yet. Surely Eldest Brother cannot be hungry?

00:07.080 --> 00:07.600
(This...)

00:09.320 --> 00:11.000
Imperial Mother, the pastry you baked is truly delicious!

00:11.080 --> 00:14.600
Good, good! So long as my Yao'er enjoys it!

00:14.760 --> 00:18.500
Later on, I shall bake several more boxes and have them delivered to your manor.

00:18.960 --> 00:22.000
Of course, Eldest Brother shall have his share as well.

00:25.080 --> 00:26.000
Thank you, Imperial Mother.
